{
  "schema": "bd-mutate-spec/1",
  "_comment": "Row 645 operator-ruling re-dispatch. M1 removes the guard from CI. M2/M3 regress the locked-vault reason/status. M4 makes even healthy readiness return 503. All four must be CAUGHT. The companion transform control applies M1 to an import-only node and must ESCAPE. No mutant permits deploy.sh to accept 503.",
  "subject": "guard health uses a real initialized and API-unlocked test vault, distinguishes locked 503, and runs in application-safety CI",
  "band": [
    "tests/test_v3_62_2_guards.py::test_status_endpoints_are_get_and_json",
    "tests/test_v3_62_2_guards.py::test_locked_master_password_vault_is_a_named_structured_503",
    "tests/test_v3_66_939_ci_gate_shards_cover_every_gate.py::test_every_explicit_shard_claim_matches_the_matrix",
    "tests/test_v3_66_939_ci_gate_shards_cover_every_gate.py::test_declared_and_ci_executed_gate_denominators_are_exact"
  ],
  "mutants": [
